[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11221.429, "timestamp": "03:07:01", "text": "你管它叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11225.269, "timestamp": "03:07:05", "text": "它像《冰雪奇缘》里那样短暂地……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11227.71, "timestamp": "03:07:07", "text": "过去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11233.99, "timestamp": "03:07:13", "text": "嗨，所以，嗯，知道今天会来吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11238.07, "timestamp": "03:07:18", "text": "真的真的很有趣，我玩得很开心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11242.91, "timestamp": "03:07:22", "text": "真的非常享受，而且收获颇丰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11249.75, "timestamp": "03:07:29", "text": "过来你那儿，呃，看着我，是的，呃，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11255.55, "timestamp": "03:07:35", "text": "我不能，我不能，呃，我不能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11258.269, "timestamp": "03:07:38", "text": "实际上，它该怎么称呼呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11262.83, "timestamp": "03:07:42", "text": "多维溪流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11267.91, "timestamp": "03:07:47", "text": "最近，呃，更痛苦了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11269.83, "timestamp": "03:07:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11272.309, "timestamp": "03:07:52", "text": "不过今天挺开心的，我们打扫了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11275.269, "timestamp": "03:07:55", "text": "很多东西都没清理干净，就像安排的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11278.229, "timestamp": "03:07:58", "text": "好多好东西，真好玩！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11279.429, "timestamp": "03:07:59", "text": "是的"}]